# update-preflight-push reads ONE file outside its own directory: the ai-dlc-update SKILL.md under test, plus the shared preamble run.sh sources.
# offender.md and nearmiss.md are in the fixture's own directory, which the runner copies without being named.
# The subject is REQUIRED and its sentinel is printed only after the subject resolves, so the SKIP exit (subject absent) cannot satisfy it.
!core/skills/ai-dlc-update/SKILL.md
core/fixtures/lib/
